This licence covers the source, themes and documentation in this repository.

PrismStudio bundles no third-party code. It imports GTK 3, VTE and
GtkSourceView through PyGObject at runtime; those are separate works under the
GNU LGPL, installed by your distribution and not redistributed here. It can
optionally drive three external programs, none of which are included and each
of which is under its own terms: the `claude` CLI, the GitHub CLI (`gh`), and
`@github/copilot-language-server`.

The application icon (`packaging/icons/`, `docs/media/icon.png`) is artwork
supplied by the project owner and is not covered by the grant above; treat it
as all rights reserved unless told otherwise.
